WEBVTT

00:19:55.807 --> 00:20:00.492
It's called Museum Mile
because everywhere is a museum.

00:20:00.516 --> 00:20:03.991
I'm going to be shooting
my outfit outside.

00:20:04.357 --> 00:20:07.242
AG: She's with her partner
who doubles as her photographer.

00:20:07.710 --> 00:20:09.062
Calvin: Your bangs are good.

00:20:09.086 --> 00:20:10.617
LS: Thank you.

00:20:11.178 --> 00:20:13.117
AG: Lyn is petite with a short white bob

00:20:13.141 --> 00:20:15.890
and bangs that stop just
above her huge sunglasses.

00:20:15.914 --> 00:20:19.049
She takes off a long velvet coat
and scans the brick facades

00:20:19.073 --> 00:20:21.104
of the Museum of the City of New York

00:20:21.128 --> 00:20:23.204
for her next spot of inspiration.

00:20:23.228 --> 00:20:25.776
LS: And right now,
that little nook over there

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:30.045
is really calling to me
because it does look like a place ...